The genes were amplified by PCR with high-fidelity Phusion DNA polymerase (New England Biolabs GmbH, Frankfurt, Germany) by the use of
C. kluyveri
genomic DNA as a template. The genes were expressed either together or individually where indicated and tagged with a 3′ or 5′ His
6
cassette.
